{"type":"message","id":"63127ba6","parentId":"3a7f1196","timestamp":"2026-04-11T09:22:33.865Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] **Recommended questions**\nThank you — that is important. **Pink/red urine plus painful urination** makes a urinary or kidney source more concerning and raises the urgency.\n\n**(2/4)** Do you also have **fever or chills**, and is the pain mainly in the **right flank/back under the ribs** or lower down near the spine/hip?","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0ca29368015116040169da12d80c448191a7f03812e6f3c730\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":4744,"output":82,"cacheRead":8960,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13786,"cost":{"input":0.01186,"output":0.00123,"cacheRead":0.00224,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01533}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775899351149}}
