{"type":"message","id":"36de7ee3","parentId":"7ab28354","timestamp":"2026-04-11T09:22:54.222Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] **Recommended questions**\nUnderstood — that location is more compatible with a **right flank/kidney-area pain** than a simple central low back ache.\n\n**(3/4)** Have you had **fever or chills** at all? And is the pain a steady dull ache only, or does it ever become **sharp/colicky in waves**?","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0ca29368015116040169da12ecb4948191bffe87e1d937ffea\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":220,"output":82,"cacheRead":13696,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":13998,"cost":{"input":0.00055,"output":0.00123,"cacheRead":0.003424,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.005204}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775899371787}}
