{"type":"message","id":"7bc0a317","parentId":"f6bffc6b","timestamp":"2026-04-11T09:26:22.999Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0ca29368015116040169da13b5b7888191bda00b99eb312afa\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABp2hO2_E2SPkZGTeCjiEz02YQCoCoHDwKz-LXeAx82lF2WPnSUpu7zu5nuC0C3f9vfeKhP2N3IEEZiFNI9qVRrFLurxWNmF_KFnk6ZRv309CHGnqXVz45ZxbXAZgZ10q8oN-E3cwJTiT7CeO91ignzbOBsODUWWwgSLEi8dxsjpCJGlpTcZECGy1Q_GZlRb4hAAHvfDFccqf2OxO40cAqoVE7U7Dr5q4IVr27rt31WSNTS4x_zcLl-Am5eeld_Uie8mMMKosMb50DgfN8PyTK_eIILzUKCQMcsmN4BSrZbZcRf66754xZ0bITk0sQls1kPihJT-HREInue0iAftTWDj7d03z7-n2kUM1e-8o0PS4DtPsDeiPGJDq5P-QA94AmRUentRGkJt47QZOPn8mHAuLq7Z9YtgMHEs2jCJJ1BBpU1QRIq6IUntKq31vhWzZBlTb50KbC5KPYwbi1opQa_B2_6PZsZY4nEWZKAUf1xTKcNn8SMiK1a3qHfDMhVAJ6O-xzovR9G5h4M-7kY0SFpT2hbQAKJ5Xp-XH85_6gO2DnZq509UuZQAZ2quz6PyBJ87f-rwgMQWndIgMxnziqmmTWI4KGgf6YWBY4PVfbq2YuCpW6Kz5JNwBVpKPaG3jL2qdmNwNV8W-mg71iY-1Etz_ESYYvIQ_RlDisov1AG1HARF-JQF8G_kJht_gxNXwEstUSFhjpW0tik9Plq5sQF2grQZE_F00y8BUaDaAttTSOeiID8yxyhr_LuHdob6zMsGwB1dABdlfUPlXbgLtSK-Ws_1ekmouMgIB3_pChdlqQ9X7K8PalyPa7J4u5vn6tXiHq6Vbo0-b5xmN0ENdeeNBO4UyNge7weNFja8D1gC4Q4PbweMOT1Ga2UJqFca8ac-Ly5UgF1-qLMuqhN82QCYb8yRXyM3ATRJtaw1Q_wAHolt0fmtlnaa_SgbgdoGRNcS4ZTEYmEZnZlEb4fsAS4ZvOR7KNfYZBS5MQAyM5htYLBbkdF2o4tMND5MqriTYHAhZ74Luu0B-AUCQO7joJi7go5zrkS3e2C84-C45ClQBlDW7g=\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] **Kidney Cancer Detector**\nThe pipeline classified the scan as **kidney tumor** with **very high model confidence (~0.9999)**.\nInference time was about **3.7 seconds**.\n\n**Image Analyzer**\nThe image analyzer also predicted **kidney_tumor**.\nIts heatmap focused on a **localized peripheral renal region** with an asymmetric pattern, which the tool describes as a region of possible structural alteration.\nMain heatmap metrics:\n- **CAM coverage:** 0.0322\n- **CAM center ratio:** 0.0495\n- **CAM left-right asymmetry:** 0.5446\n- **CAM top-bottom asymmetry:** 1.0000\n\nA heatmap image is attached below for visual reference.\n\n**xAI**\nThe downstream interpretation says the model is showing a **high-confidence kidney-cancer-related signal** on this image.\nIt summarizes the visual evidence as a **kidney tumor appearance** and recommends:\n1. **Prompt review by a radiologist or clinician**\n2. **Correlation with your medical history and additional testing**\n\n**Result Interpretation**\nTaken together, this pipeline is **concerning** and it does fit with the broader picture you described earlier: **right flank pain, blood in the urine, painful urination, marked fatigue, and major unintended weight loss**, on top of your prior **RCC follow-up history**.\nThat said, this tool is **not a diagnosis**. It is a **preliminary signal** and should be treated as support for urgent medical evaluation, not as confirmation by itself.\n\n**Recommended next steps**\nBecause of both your symptoms and this imaging result, I would strongly recommend **urgent in-person assessment today**, ideally through your oncology/urology team or the **ER if same-day specialist access is not possible**.\nThe most useful next clinical steps would usually be:\n- **urgent clinician review of the CT**\n- **urinalysis**\n- **CBC / kidney function bloodwork**\n- further **urologic/oncologic assessment**\n\nMEDIA:http://looporchestra.sytes.net:4001/admin/admin/retrieve-image-file/nodes_bucket/626130f7c71f6b9e651c76be/69b862e0a6fbd73a6254e5be/2f326f4f-6e6e-4a65-b52a-a1c252707ea3.jpg\n\nIf you want, the next useful step here is to run the **LLM Distillation** tool so I can turn **your symptoms + history + this pipeline output** into one clear medical report with suggested next steps.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0ca29368015116040169da13b6cdc08191a18e99c7a768274c\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":9625,"output":589,"cacheRead":16768,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26982,"cost":{"input":0.0240625,"output":0.008835,"cacheRead":0.0041919999999999995,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.037089500000000004}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775899571533}}
