{"type":"message","id":"a6b4969e","parentId":"c6611431","timestamp":"2026-04-11T09:28:01.219Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] You can send this:\n\n**Short message for ER / specialist**\nHello, I need an urgent evaluation today. I have a history of **renal cell carcinoma follow-up** and **post-nephrectomy monitoring**. Over the last few months I have developed **progressively worsening right flank/right back pain**, **visible blood in the urine**, **painful urination**, **marked fatigue**, and **about 28 kg of unintentional weight loss over 3 months**. I recently also had a CT image reviewed through a preliminary analysis tool that flagged a **kidney tumor signal**, and I would like urgent clinical/radiology review, urine tests, blood tests, and kidney function assessment.\n\nIf you want an even shorter version:\n\n**Very short version**\nHistory of kidney cancer follow-up / nephrectomy. Now with worsening right flank pain, gross hematuria, painful urination, severe fatigue, and major unintended weight loss over 3 months. Requesting urgent evaluation today.\n\nThank you — and I hope you get seen quickly.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0ca29368015116040169da141d823c8191827f4aee89548ef2\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":4073,"output":220,"cacheRead":26624,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":30917,"cost":{"input":0.0101825,"output":0.0033,"cacheRead":0.006656,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0201385}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775899674929}}
